      "content": "but \"letting it settle\" doesn't change the fact that the math doesn't add up anymore. i'm 45. i can't just restart. i've put everything into this, and now i'm standing there with zero. it just feels like a bad investment. like i've spent all my resources and there's nothing left to show for it. why bother trying to find \"relief\" when the whole thing is just a loss?",
